<title>JAPAN: Stock ratings list - Yamaichi Research (Jun 18).</title>
<headline>Stock ratings list - Yamaichi Research (Jun 18).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Follows is a list of ratings on Wednesday by Yamaichi Research Institute of Securities and Economics Inc.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>First time rated:</p>
<p>Teijin Seiki Co Ltd -- &quot;1&quot;</p>
<p>Kito Corp -- &quot;1&quot;</p>
<p>Mitsubishi Materials Corp -- &quot;2&quot; --------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Rating unchanged:</p>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp -- &quot;1&quot;</p>
<p>Honda Motor Co Ltd -- &quot;1&quot;</p>
<p>Bridgestone Corp -- &quot;1&quot;</p>
<p>Denso Corporation -- &quot;2&quot;</p>
<p>Nissan Motor Co Ltd -- &quot;2&quot;</p>
<p>NOK Corp -- &quot;2&quot; --------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The research institute assigns ratings as follows:</p>
<p>&quot;1&quot; - issues expected to outperform the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section TOPIX index by more than 10 percentage points over the following six months.</p>
<p>&quot;2&quot; - issues seen moving within 10 percentage points in either direction of the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section TOPIX index over the next six months.</p>
<p>&quot;3&quot; - issues expected to underperform the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section TOPIX index by more than 10 percentage points over the following six months.</p>
</text>
